{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53852","headline":"訾州宴游 · 杨汉公","name":"訾州宴游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂林云物画漫漫，雨里花开雨里残。\n惟有今朝好风景，樱桃含笑柳眉攒。\n（见唐莫休符《桂林风土记》、清汪森辑《粤西诗载》卷二二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨汉公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}